#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:6
msgid "U-mode Driver Sample"
msgstr "U-mode 驱动示例"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:10
msgid ""
"A sample application demonstrating the TLK U-mode API. It switches the "
"core from Machine mode (M-mode) to User mode (U-mode), executes a task "
"under reduced privilege, optionally dispatches a service request back to "
"M-mode via `ecall`, and optionally returns to M-mode permanently through "
"`tlk_core_mmode`."
msgstr ""
"一个示例应用程序，演示了 TLK U-mode API 的使用。它将内核从机器模式（M-mode）切换到用户模式（U-mode），在降低的权限下执行任务，可选地通过 `ecall` 将服务请求发送回 M-mode，并可选择通过 `tlk_core_mmode` 永久返回 M-mode。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:15
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:17
msgid "On startup the sample:"
msgstr "启动时，该示例："

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:19
msgid ""
"Registers `ecall_handler` as the ecall exception callback via "
"`tlk_trap_register_ecall_callback`."
msgstr "通过 `tlk_trap_register_ecall_callback` 注册 `ecall_handler` 作为 ecall 异常回调。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:21
msgid ""
"Configures PMP entry 7 to grant full RWX access to the entire 4 GB "
"address space — this is the baseline permission for U-mode."
msgstr "配置 PMP 条目 7，授予对整个 4 GB 地址空间的完全 RWX 访问权限 — 这是 U-mode 的基准权限。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:23
msgid ""
"*(Optional)* If `CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_UART` is **not** set, "
"configures PMP entry 0 to deny all access to the UART peripheral region. "
"Because PMP entries are checked from lowest index first, entry 0 "
"overrides entry 7 for that range, blocking any UART access from U-mode."
msgstr ""
"*(可选)* 如果**未**设置 `CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_UART`，则配置 PMP 条目 0 拒绝所有对 UART 外设区域的访问。由于 PMP 条目从最低索引开始检查，条目 0 在该范围内覆盖条目 7，阻止从 U-mode 的任何 UART 访问。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:27
msgid "Calls `tlk_core_umode(user_task, task_handler)` to switch to U-mode:"
msgstr "调用 `tlk_core_umode(user_task, task_handler)` 切换到 U-mode："

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:28
msgid ""
"**`user_task`** executes in U-mode and attempts to send `\"User "
"task.\\n\"` over UART0. Succeeds only if "
"`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_UART` is set; otherwise a PMP violation "
"trap fires on the first UART register access. If "
"`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_SLEEP` is set, `user_task` also sets "
"`USER_REQUEST_SLEEP` before returning."
msgstr ""
"**`user_task`** 在 U-mode 下执行，尝试通过 UART0 发送 `\"User task.\\n\"`。仅在设置了 `CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_UART` 时成功；否则，在首次访问 UART 寄存器时会触发 PMP 违规异常。如果设置了 `CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_SLEEP`，`user_task` 还会在返回前设置 `USER_REQUEST_SLEEP`。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:33
msgid ""
"After `user_task` returns, **`task_handler`** executes in U-mode. This "
"function calls the `ecall`."
msgstr "`user_task` 返回后，**`task_handler`** 在 U-mode 下执行。该函数调用 `ecall`。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:34
msgid ""
"The `ecall` causes an environment-call trap which transfers control to "
"M-mode where **`ecall_handler`** runs:"
msgstr "`ecall` 导致环境调用异常，将控制权转移到 M-mode，在那里 **`ecall_handler`** 运行："

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:36
msgid ""
"If `USER_REQUEST_SLEEP` is set, it logs `\"Ecall. Sleep 1s.\\n\"`, sleeps"
" for 1 second via `tlk_api_sleep`, then clears the request."
msgstr "如果设置了 `USER_REQUEST_SLEEP`，它会记录 `\"Ecall. Sleep 1s.\\n\"`，通过 `tlk_api_sleep` 睡眠 1 秒，然后清除请求。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:38
msgid ""
"If `CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_MMODE` is set, it calls "
"`tlk_core_mmode()` to permanently restore M-mode privilege before "
"returning."
msgstr "如果设置了 `CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_MMODE`，它会在返回前调用 `tlk_core_mmode()` 永久恢复 M-mode 权限。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:40
msgid ""
"After `tlk_core_umode` returns, `main` performs a privilege check: it "
"attempts to read the `mstatus` CSR. This read succeeds in M-mode and "
"raises an illegal-instruction exception in U-mode. If "
"`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_MMODE` is not set, `ecall_handler` never "
"calls `tlk_core_mmode()`, so execution returns to `main` still in U-mode "
"and the read traps."
msgstr ""
"在 `tlk_core_umode` 返回后，`main` 执行权限检查：它尝试读取 `mstatus` CSR。该读取在 M-mode 下成功，在 U-mode 下会触发非法指令异常。如果未设置 `CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_MMODE`，`ecall_handler` 不会调用 `tlk_core_mmode()`，因此执行返回到 `main` 时仍处于 U-mode，读取操作将触发异常。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:46
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:48
msgid "All options are exposed via **Kconfig** under *U-mode Demo Configuration*."
msgstr "所有选项都通过 **Kconfig** 中的 *U-mode Demo Configuration* 提供。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "Symbol"
msgstr "符号"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_UART`"
msgstr "`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_UART`"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "`bool`"
msgstr "`bool`"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "`n`"
msgstr "`n`"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid ""
"Allow U-mode access to the UART peripheral. When disabled, PMP entry 0 is"
" configured to deny all access to the UART region, causing a PMP "
"violation trap on any UART access attempted from U-mode."
msgstr "允许 U-mode 访问 UART 外设。禁用时，PMP 条目 0 被配置为拒绝所有对 UART 区域的访问，导致从 U-mode 尝试的任何 UART 访问触发 PMP 违规异常。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_SLEEP`"
msgstr "`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_SLEEP`"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid ""
"Enable the sleep service request. When set, `user_task` issues a "
"`USER_REQUEST_SLEEP` request before returning, causing `ecall_handler` to"
" perform a 1-second sleep in M-mode."
msgstr "启用睡眠服务请求。设置后，`user_task` 在返回前发出 `USER_REQUEST_SLEEP` 请求，使 `ecall_handler` 在 M-mode 下执行 1 秒睡眠。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid "`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_MMODE`"
msgstr "`CONFIG_TLK_UMODE_DEMO_ENABLE_MMODE`"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md
msgid ""
"Return to M-mode after the ecall. When set, `ecall_handler` calls "
"`tlk_core_mmode()` so that execution continues in `main` with full M-mode"
" privilege. When disabled, `main` remains in U-mode after "
"`tlk_core_umode` returns, and the subsequent `mstatus` CSR read raises an"
" illegal-instruction exception."
msgstr "在 ecall 后返回 M-mode。设置后，`ecall_handler` 调用 `tlk_core_mmode()`，使 `main` 以完全 M-mode 权限继续执行。禁用时，`main` 在 `tlk_core_umode` 返回后仍处于 U-mode，后续的 `mstatus` CSR 读取会触发非法指令异常。"

#: ../../source/samples/umode.md:56
msgid ""
"**Note:** With all options disabled the sample demonstrates two "
"protections in sequence: a PMP violation trap when `user_task` touches "
"the blocked UART region, and an illegal-instruction trap when `main` "
"attempts to read a privileged CSR from U-mode."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 在所有选项都禁用的情况下，示例依次演示两种保护：当 `user_task` 访问被阻止的 UART 区域时触发 PMP 违规异常，以及当 `main` 尝试从 U-mode 读取特权 CSR 时触发非法指令异常。"
